        "marry :parameters (?p1 - canmarry ?p2 - person ?loc - location) :precondition (and (alive ?p1) (alive ?p2) (at ?p1 ?loc) (at ?p2 ?loc) (loves ?p1 ?p2) (loves ?p2 ?p1) (single ?p1) (bachelor ?p1) (single ?p2) (not (= ?p1 ?p2))) :effect (and (married-to ?p1 ?p2) (married-to ?p2 ?p1) (not (single ?p1)) (not (single ?p2))))": "(:action marry :parameters (?p1 - canmarry ?p2 - person ?loc - location) :precondition (and (alive ?p1) (alive ?p2) (at ?p1 ?loc) (at ?p2 ?loc) (loves ?p1 ?p2) (loves ?p2 ?p1) (single ?p1) (bachelor ?p1) (single ?p2) (not (= ?p1 ?p2))) :effect (and (married-to ?p1 ?p2) (married-to ?p2 ?p1) (not (single ?p1)) (not (single ?p2))))",
