        "command :parameters (?p - person ?g - genie ?beloved - person ?t - thing ?l - location) :precondition (and (magic ?t) (has ?p ?t) (controls ?p ?g ?t) (alive ?p) (magic-char ?g) (magic-char-alive) (alive ?beloved) (at ?p ?l) (at ?g ?l) (loves ?p ?beloved) (not (loves ?beloved ?p)) (not (= ?p ?g)) (not (= ?p ?beloved))) :effect (and (intends-loves ?g ?beloved ?p)))": "(:action command :parameters (?p - person ?g - genie ?beloved - person ?t - thing ?l - location) :precondition (and (magic ?t) (has ?p ?t) (controls ?p ?g ?t) (alive ?p) (magic-char ?g) (magic-char-alive) (alive ?beloved) (at ?p ?l) (at ?g ?l) (loves ?p ?beloved) (not (loves ?beloved ?p)) (not (= ?p ?g)) (not (= ?p ?beloved))) :effect (and (intends-loves ?g ?beloved ?p)))"
